    "updated_at": "2025-10-27T16:32:49Z",
    "body": "> ( I can't seem to wonder how the implementations and spec don't match. )\n\nI wasn't involved when this was developed but I remember this being a giant spec PR for months while iterating on the prototype. The navigation API in general is on the more complicated side of recent web APIs so I am not totally surprised that some differences come up alongside the 2nd and 3rd implementation a few years after. Happy to chat about this more at TPAC.",
